      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MY CUPCAKE (5) has a strong record this track and trip with five wins and two placings from 12 starts. Was out of the placings last time (29.70) at Wentworth Park in a Grade 4/5, finishing fourth and beaten 2.5 lengths. Looks suited and should go close. LADY LLORONA (7) found the going tougher last start when finishing 8th over 520m at Wentworth Park. Was a winner the start prior in easier at Gosford. The form out of her last race has been franked. Should be in this for a long way. COLD COLD NIGHT (8) has a strong record this track and trip with three wins and two placings from seven starts. Missed the frame latest (30.49) when seventh over 515m at this track in a Grade 5. Looks suited here and can measure up.",
